<Legal title="Privacy policy" description="How Sanchay Technologies collects, uses, stores and protects personal data." updated="20 November 2026">
  <p>
    This policy explains what personal data Sanchay Technologies ("we", "us") collects through sanchaytechnologies.com and our
    trading platform at trade.sanchaytechnologies.com, why we collect it, and the choices you have. We follow the Information
    Technology Act, 2000 and the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><b>Enquiry forms:</b> name, email, phone number, city, company, the service you are interested in and your message.</li>
    <li><b>Platform accounts:</b> name, email, mobile number, login records, and the settings you choose.</li>
    <li><b>Broker connections:</b> the broker, client code and the access tokens or API keys you give us to place orders on your behalf.</li>
    <li><b>Trading records:</b> orders, positions and trade history created through the platform.</li>
    <li><b>Technical data:</b> IP address, browser type and request logs used for security and to keep the service running.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To reply to your enquiry and send you a quote or demo.</li>
    <li>To run the service you signed up for: place orders, apply your limits, show your positions and reports.</li>
    <li>To keep accounts secure, detect misuse and keep audit records.</li>
    <li>To meet legal, tax and regulatory obligations.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell personal data. We do not use your data for advertising by third parties.</p>

  <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Your broker, only to place and track the orders you asked for.</li>
    <li>Service providers who host or operate our systems, under confidentiality obligations.</li>
    <li>Authorities, when the law requires it.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we protect it</h2>
  <p>
    Broker credentials and tokens are encrypted at rest. Access to production systems is limited to authorised staff, and important
    actions are recorded in an audit log. No system is perfectly secure, so please keep your passwords private and tell us at once
    if you think your account was misused.
  </p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>
    Enquiries are kept for as long as needed to respond and follow up. Account and trading records are kept while your account is
    active and afterwards for as long as the law requires.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask to see, correct or delete your personal data, or withdraw consent, by emailing <a href="mailto:info@sanchaytechnologies.com">info@sanchaytechnologies.com</a>. Some records must be kept by law even after an account is closed.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    This website does not use advertising or tracking cookies. The trading platform uses essential cookies to keep you signed in.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy. The date at the top shows the latest version.</p>

  <h2>Contact and grievances</h2>
  <p>For questions or complaints about your data, email <a href="mailto:info@sanchaytechnologies.com">info@sanchaytechnologies.com</a>. We reply within 7 working days.</p>
</Legal>
